<title>SPAIN: TABLE-Gas Natural H1 results detailed.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Gas Natural H1 results detailed.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June results for Gas Natural group (in billions of pesetas, unless stated):</p>
<p>Net turnover				    208.34   vs 166.88</p>
<p>Total production value			212.76   vs 170.63</p>
<p>Net purchases				   114.72   vs  77.03</p>
